{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2015-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1432425600, "end_date": 1433116799, "month_true_total": 1136, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:03:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "16107768", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097559744", "personaname": "J-Train", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198097559744/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 30240, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9403, "last_played": 1607500462, "avatar": "e9acdd3ff7124e1c27b65e2f7377fcc43c3024f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's okay, I play it SOMETIMES...", "timestamp_created": 1433114397, "timestamp_updated": 1433114397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16106956", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072292835", "personaname": "[901st]BeardyTheDwarf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BeardyTheDwarf/", "num_games_owned": 177, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 16462, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7194, "last_played": 1565651014, "avatar": "80df0bbbffc6b8846d46b655fd4df05dfa6ad596"}, "language": "english", "review": "How to explain Arma III\nHonestly it's quite hard to explain it there are so many options to it and so many tactical ways of winning the battle. \nARMA III Truly is a Teambased Shooter where depending on your squad you can clear out a village/city in no time \n\nDo be advised though if you do not like to die alot dont get it. \n\nMy favorite online mode is Domination where you will recieve objectives primarily focused on taking over small villages to defensive towns \n\nIf you like shooting and want to feel like you are playing as an actual soldier rather then a running and shooting for the kills \n\nI truly advice you to get this game.. \n\nI grade it 9/10 because the game sometimes can be quite laggy", "timestamp_created": 1433110459, "timestamp_updated": 1433110459, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16106443", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138619187", "personaname": "Massa611", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198138619187/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1120, "last_played": 1690746658, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It had the potential to be a very good game but was spoilt by how rushed it seems.  Its very glitchy, completely riddled with glitches.  I often get stuck in the walls and floor, and sometimes i die from falling less then five feet, other times I can fall four stories and be fine (usually because i get stuck in the side of the building halfway down).  Other misc glitches like menus will stop working so I need to go out then go back in, othertimes my guy will spend most of the mission saying \"im low on ammo\" when he's got loads.\n\nThe gameplay also seems a little shallow to be honest, for what is trying to be a realistic strategy game.  I remember reading a lot of bragging about the AI of this game, bragging they didnt use scripts.  They should have used scripts.  Controlling my guys can have me pulling my hair out sometimes!\n\nI had high hopes because of the games concept, but they didnt put enough effort into this game before release.  Not recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1433108272, "timestamp_updated": 1433108272, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16105664", "author": {"steamid": "76561198171502418", "personaname": "ツ Awezome", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/awezomeman/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2671, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2621, "last_played": 1640216441, "avatar": "7dc9f7f96334e9438aca7588fe82fc1b80aa8c4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "it would look good if i had a good pc\n\nEdit: finally can run it", "timestamp_created": 1433105226, "timestamp_updated": 1582162498, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16105363", "author": {"steamid": "76561198132878552", "personaname": "TJKANZLER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TJKANZLER/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 116260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8037, "last_played": 1684082309, "avatar": "ec22e58f772b8b3f9f92cf0d837b830eaafebe2e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best FPS on the market.", "timestamp_created": 1433104006, "timestamp_updated": 1433104006, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496240615844726562", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "